      </ul>
      <p>
        Of the 526 LAAs, 49 went to candidates who declared a valid Express Entry profile number and job seeker validation code. The notice also warns that people who claimed to be fully licensed in a regulated occupation but are not may have their full application refused, and suggests they consider declining the LAA.
      </p>

